  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.<br>• Slice brown onion (see ingredients)<br>into wedges.<br>• Cut cauliflower into small florets. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-a00d7400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place sweet potato, cauliflower and onion on a <br>lined oven tray.<br>• Drizzle generously with olive oil, sprinkle with<br>garlic &amp; herb seasoning and season with salt<br>and pepper. <br>• Toss to coat, spread out evenly, then roast until <br>tender, 20-25 minutes.<br>• Remove veggies from oven and set aside to <br>cool slightly. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-f0590f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, heat a large saucepan over <br>medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. <br>Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, <br>until golden, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Carefully half-fill the saucepan with water, then <br>add a pinch of salt. <br>• Simmer, uncovered, until tender, 14-16 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-78acf920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Drain couscous and return to saucepan with <br>stock concentrate and a drizzle of olive oil. Stir <br>to combine</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-135ec630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, combine spinach &amp; rocket mix, <br>roasted veggies, couscous and basil pesto. <br>Season to taste. <br><br>TIP: Add the salad and roasted veggies to the <br>couscous saucepan and toss everything together to <br>save on washing up! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-6cdf4c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide cauliflower and pearl couscous between <br>bowls. Sprinkle with flaked almonds and drizzle <br>over dill &amp; parsley mayonnaise to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-a4a54c50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
